thunderbolt-net (0.2.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Add RX page recycling and lifecycle fixes for version 0.2.0.
  * Add opt-in DMA-mapped RX recycling and NAPI allocation/lifecycle changes.
  * Add reproducible RX-core model tests and a missing-sync negative control.
  * Serialize RX startup/teardown and backport upstream connection cleanup.
  * Document bounded hardware evidence, opt-in configuration and rollback.

